  "body": "[polytouchin] outputs MIDI polyphonic aftertouch: the aftertouch value, note number and channel. It listens on all channels by default; an argument sets the channel and removes the channel outlet. Channels above 16 address further ports: 17 to 32 are channels 1 to 16 of port 2, and so on."
